### What happened?

`tool_search` misses a deferred tool when the matching parameter description is behind a local `$ref`. Inlining the same schema makes the tool discoverable. MCP input normalization preserves these references.

### Steps to reproduce

Give a deferred tool named `mcp__ledger__inspect`, described as `Inspect records`, these parameters:

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": { "options": { "$ref": "#/$defs/options" } },
  "$defs": {
    "options": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": { "mode": { "type": "string", "description": "reconciliation" } }
    }
  }
}
